      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHADOW REAPER (2) has an excellent record over this journey having never missed the placings in seven starts, including four wins and three placings. Was out of placings last time (43.00) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing sixth and beaten 8 lengths. Looks a leading chance on best. WEST ON MODEL (1) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 10 lengths fifth (35.32) last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 601m. Can do much better this time. ASTON RULER (6) has a strong record here with 14 wins and nine placings from 36 starts. Comes off a (29.92) win last time, scoring by 2.75 lengths in a Grade 5 over 520m at this track. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. JUST A PRINCESS (4) drops in journey and can play a major role.",
